<title>INDIA: P&amp;O Australia to build $1 bln port in India.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O Australia to build $1 bln port in India.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>P&amp;O Australia Ports Pvt Ltd has signed an agreement to develop a port in India's wealthiest state of Maharashtra at a cost of $1 billion, Chief Minister Manohar Joshi told an infrastructure seminar on Monday.</p>
</text>
